      "prompt": "Share $48 in the ratio 2:3. Show your working.",
      "blueprintRow": 0,
      "commandWord": "Calculate",
      "marks": 5,
      "markScheme": {
        "points": [
          {
            "text": "Adds the parts to find 5 equal parts in the whole",
            "marks": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Divides $48 by 5 for one part, then multiplies to get $19.20 and $28.80",
            "marks": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "prompt": "Explain why the 3-part share of $48 cannot be $72, using the whole bar.",
      "blueprintRow": 0,
      "commandWord": "Explain",
      "marks": 5,
      "markScheme": {
        "points": [
          {
            "text": "States that the parts are counted out of the 5 parts of the whole, not out of 2",
            "marks": 2
          },
          {
            "text": "Concludes 3 parts is 3/5 of $48, which is $28.80, and $72 is more than the whole",
            "marks": 3
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "prompt": "Calculate 1/2 + 1/4. Show your working.",
      "blueprintRow": 1,
      "commandWord": "Calculate",
      "marks": 5,
      "markScheme": {
        "points": [
